{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_reksai": {
        "attack": "【附加包】爪咬。<#ff9028ff>艾克塞之怒<>：命中攒怒气，满怒时下一口是<#ff9028ff>狂野之噬<>（<#4fc3f7ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#4fc3f7ff>110%<><#4fc3f7ff>真实伤害<>）。脱离战斗赶路时<#ff9028ff>遁地<>：整个身体钻进土里、移速提高，按怒气回复生命，敌人靠近就破土。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】钻地冲到目标脚下破土：<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>击飞1秒<>。起点和落点连成<#ff9028ff>隧道<>（最多8个入口，敌方英雄站上去会踩塌）；残血或突袭时钻隧道。",
        "ult": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>猎物<>里有能被打死的才放：钻进地底<#ffb900ff>0.9秒<>，再扑出造成<#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>+目标最大生命15%<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_reksai": {
        "attack": "【擴充包】爪咬。<#ff9028ff>憤怒沙蟲<>：命中累積怒氣，滿怒時下一口是<#ff9028ff>狂食<>（<#4fc3f7ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#4fc3f7ff>110%<><#4fc3f7ff>真實傷害<>）。脫離戰鬥趕路時<#ff9028ff>深掘<>：整個身體鑽進土裡、移速提高，按怒氣回復生命，敵人靠近就破土。",
        "skill2": "【擴充包】鑽地衝到目標腳下破土：<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<><#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>擊飛1秒<>。起點和落點連成<#ff9028ff>隧道<>（最多8個入口，敵方英雄站上去會踩塌）；殘血或突襲時鑽隧道。",
        "ult": "【擴充包】<#ff9028ff>獵物<>裡有能被打死的才施放：鑽進地底<#ffb900ff>0.9秒<>，再撲出造成<#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>+目標最大生命15%<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_reksai": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] Claws and bites. <#ff9028ff>Fury of the Xer'Sai<>: hits build Fury; at full Fury her next bite is <#ff9028ff>Furious Bite<> (<#4fc3f7ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#4fc3f7ff>110%<> <#4fc3f7ff>true damage<>). Out of combat on the move she <#ff9028ff>burrows<>: her whole body under the earth, faster, healing by her Fury, and comes up when enemies near.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Tunnels under the target and bursts up: <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, <#ef5350ff>knocking up 1s<>. Start and landing become a <#ff9028ff>tunnel<> (8 entrances at most; enemy champions standing on one cave it in); she takes them to escape or to strike.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Only when one of her <#ff9028ff>Prey<> would die: she goes under for <#ffb900ff>0.9s<> and lunges for <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> + 15% of its max health <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_reksai": {
        "attack": "[확장] 할퀴고 문다. <#ff9028ff>제르사이의 분노<>: 적중 시 분노, 가득하면 다음 공격이 <#ff9028ff>성난 이빨<>(<#4fc3f7ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#4fc3f7ff>110%<>의 <#4fc3f7ff>고정 피해<>). 비전투 이동 중 <#ff9028ff>매복<>: 몸 전체가 땅속으로, 더 빠르게, 분노로 회복, 적이 다가오면 솟아오름.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 대상 발밑으로 파고들어 솟아오름: <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<>의 <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>와 <#ef5350ff>1초 에어본<>. 출발점과 도착점이 <#ff9028ff>땅굴<>이 됨(입구 최대 8개, 적 챔피언이 밟으면 무너짐); 도주나 기습에 사용.",
        "ult": "[확장] <#ff9028ff>먹잇감<> 중 처치할 수 있는 대상이 있을 때만: <#ffb900ff>0.9초<> 땅속 후 덮쳐 <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> + 대상 최대 체력 15%의 <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_reksai": {
        "attack": "【拡張】爪と牙で攻撃。<#ff9028ff>ゼル＝サイの怒り<>：命中で怒り、最大時の次の攻撃は<#ff9028ff>激情の牙<>（<#4fc3f7ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#4fc3f7ff>110%<>の<#4fc3f7ff>確定ダメージ<>）。非戦闘の移動中は<#ff9028ff>潜伏<>：全身が地中へ、速く、怒りで回復、敵が近づくと浮上。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】対象の足元へ潜って襲撃：<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>と<#ef5350ff>1秒ノックアップ<>。出発点と着地点が<#ff9028ff>トンネル<>に（入口最大8、敵チャンピオンが踏むと崩れる）。逃走や奇襲に使う。",
        "ult": "【拡張】<#ff9028ff>獲物<>に倒せる相手がいる時だけ：<#ffb900ff>0.9秒<>地中へ、飛び出して<#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>+対象の最大体力15%の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>。"
      }
    }
  }
}
